1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,813
It BREATHED! The gate BREATHED at me!

2
00:00:01,913 --> 00:00:04,989
Mmm... fresh dough... come closer...

3
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:08,333
I told you. Don't wake him.

4
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:13,248
Okay team, nobody move. Nobody breathe. Nobody... sneeze.

5
00:00:13,348 --> 00:00:16,184
Zzz... squish... zzz...

6
00:00:16,284 --> 00:00:21,014
Behind the garden gate sleeps a giant. And Pim is holding the key.

7
00:00:21,114 --> 00:00:25,524
My calculations say that is a jelly. A VERY large jelly.

8
00:00:25,624 --> 00:00:29,181
He looks so soft. Like a big green pillow!

9
00:00:29,281 --> 00:00:34,427
That pillow is Wobblor. Whatever goes in... stays in.

10
00:00:34,527 --> 00:00:36,164
S-s-stays? Like... forever?

11
00:00:36,265 --> 00:00:41,507
Fascinating. He has eaten a spoon, two buttons and a very surprised snail.

12
00:00:41,607 --> 00:00:44,461
A snail? Oh, the poor little thing!

13
00:00:44,561 --> 00:00:47,757
Okay, cool, cool, cool. I'll just hold the key REALLY tight.

14
00:00:47,856 --> 00:00:48,581
Whoops.

15
00:00:50,182 --> 00:00:52,053
Pim! The Golden Crumb!

16
00:00:52,153 --> 00:00:54,171
It rolled! It rolled right into his BELLY!

17
00:00:54,270 --> 00:00:57,058
Hee hee... it tickles... zzz...

18
00:00:57,159 --> 00:01:02,188
Here's the plan. Lolly sings him deeper to sleep. I reach in and grab it.

19
00:01:02,287 --> 00:01:06,846
Wait! Take my Jelly-Gloves 3000. Totally safe. Probably.

20
00:01:06,947 --> 00:01:10,675
La la loo... sleep tight, big wobbly friend...

21
00:01:10,775 --> 00:01:13,803
Mmm... pretty song... zzz...

22
00:01:13,902 --> 00:01:16,392
Almost... almost... got it!

23
00:01:17,892 --> 00:01:21,193
Oh no. The gloves are made of sugar. My bad.

24
00:01:21,293 --> 00:01:22,550
Ah... ahh... AHHH-CHOO!

25
00:01:22,650 --> 00:01:24,672
WHO... woke... ME?

26
00:01:24,772 --> 00:01:28,039
Little doughs! Stay inside me... it's comfy!

27
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:29,819
Run! Everyone run!

28
00:01:29,919 --> 00:01:32,729
Too late. Wobblor slurps Bup right up.

29
00:01:32,829 --> 00:01:37,196
Guys? It's dark in here. And sticky. And it smells like grapes.

30
00:01:37,296 --> 00:01:38,819
Let. Him. GO!

31
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:42,067
Hee hee! Angry cookies are the squishiest!

32
00:01:42,167 --> 00:01:43,595
N-n-nope! I can't watch!

33
00:01:43,695 --> 00:01:48,724
Pim fainted. Again. Statistically, that is his fourth time this week.

34
00:01:48,824 --> 00:01:51,222
Zeek! Do something smart! NOW!

35
00:01:51,322 --> 00:01:56,308
Plan B! The Wobble-Shaker 3000! It shakes him until he coughs!

36
00:01:56,408 --> 00:01:59,316
Hee hee hee! Again! Shake me AGAIN!

37
00:01:59,416 --> 00:02:03,015
Plan B has made him happier. That was not the goal.

38
00:02:03,115 --> 00:02:06,458
Guys, hurry! He's starting to sing to me in here!

39
00:02:06,558 --> 00:02:09,681
Stay... stay... stay inside me forever...

40
00:02:09,782 --> 00:02:15,157
Jelly hates one thing. Heat. And my ember is warm again.

41
00:02:15,256 --> 00:02:18,414
Crispy, wait! You'll get stuck in there too!

42
00:02:18,514 --> 00:02:23,356
I've been stuck in worse places. Like Mr. Pot.

43
00:02:23,456 --> 00:02:26,471
Wobblor. Do you remember me?

44
00:02:26,571 --> 00:02:29,862
Warm... too warm... it's melting my tummy!

45
00:02:29,963 --> 00:02:31,865
Hee... hee... BLEHHH!

46
00:02:31,965 --> 00:02:34,199
I'm out! And I've got the key!

47
00:02:34,299 --> 00:02:36,982
Yay! Sorry for yelling, Mister Wobblor.

48
00:02:37,082 --> 00:02:39,328
Did we win? Is it over? Can we go home now?

49
00:02:39,427 --> 00:02:42,958
You don't understand. I wasn't guarding the gate from you...

50
00:02:43,058 --> 00:02:45,487
I was guarding it from HIM.

51
00:02:45,587 --> 00:02:49,250
Him? Who is him? I dislike unclear pronouns.

52
00:02:49,350 --> 00:02:52,052
Please say a bunny. Please say a tiny, friendly bunny.

53
00:02:52,152 --> 00:02:56,138
Not a bunny. Something HOT... and very, very hungry.

54
00:02:56,237 --> 00:03:00,492
Thank you, little doughs. The jelly is out of my way...

55
00:03:00,592 --> 00:03:04,336
And now the key is MINE. Time to FRY!

56
00:03:04,436 --> 00:03:08,314
Mr. Pot. Everyone... behind me.

57
00:03:08,414 --> 00:03:10,869
Can I faint again? Is fainting allowed right now?!
